// Settings panel translations.
"Lid angle" = "屏幕开合角度";
"This Mac has no lid angle sensor. Only some MacBook models have one." = "这台 Mac 没有屏幕开合角度传感器。只有部分 MacBook 机型配备该传感器。";
"Depth effect" = "景深效果";
"Leans the screen away as the lid closes." = "合上屏幕时，画面会向后倾斜。";
"Press Esc to end it at once." = "按 Esc 键可立即结束效果。";
"Live rendering" = "实时渲染";
"Off holds the frame from when the effect started." = "关闭后，画面将停留在效果开始时的那一帧。";
"Screen capture" = "屏幕录制";
"Draws the effect from a capture of the screen, with lean and perspective. Needs Screen Recording permission and more power. Off, macOS blurs and dims the live screen itself." = "通过录制屏幕绘制效果，支持后倾和透视，但需要屏幕录制权限且更耗电。关闭后，由 macOS 直接模糊并调暗实时画面。";
"macOS on this Mac cannot blur the screen itself, so the effect captures it." = "这台 Mac 上的 macOS 无法直接模糊屏幕，因此效果改为录制屏幕。";
"Start" = "触发设置";
"Timeout" = "超时";
"Ends the effect once the angle stops changing." = "角度不再变化时结束效果。";
"Start angle" = "起始角度";
"The effect starts at this angle." = "屏幕合至此角度时开始生效。";
"Lowered to %.0f° so opening the lid fully still ends the effect." = "已降至 %.0f°，确保完全打开屏幕时仍能结束效果。";
"Full effect after" = "完全生效所需角度";
"Degrees of further closing to reach full strength." = "继续合上此角度后，效果达到最强。";
"Look" = "外观";
"Blur" = "模糊强度";
"Blur radius at the far edge." = "画面远端边缘的模糊半径。";
"Blur spread" = "模糊范围";
"0 blurs the far edge only, 100 the whole picture." = "0 仅模糊远端边缘，100 则模糊整个画面。";
"Dimming" = "变暗强度";
"How dark the far edge goes." = "画面远端边缘的变暗程度。";
"Dimming spread" = "变暗范围";
"Everything above this height goes fully dark." = "此高度以上的画面达到最大变暗强度。";
"Perspective" = "透视";
"Lean back" = "后倾幅度";
"Degrees of lean per degree of closing. 1 holds it still." = "每合上 1° 时画面的后倾角度。设为 1 时，画面在空间中保持不动。";
"Max lean" = "最大后倾";
"The picture stops leaning back past this angle." = "画面后倾到此角度后不再继续。";
"0 keeps the sides parallel, 100 converges sharply." = "0 保持两侧平行，100 则使两侧明显向内收拢。";
"Haptics" = "触感";
"Trackpad taps" = "触控板轻触";
"Taps the trackpad as the lid closes. Felt with a finger resting on it." = "合上屏幕时轻触触控板。手指放在触控板上即可感受到。";
"Pattern" = "模式";
"Try" = "试一试";
"Linear" = "线性";
"Exponential" = "指数";
"Swell" = "渐强";
"Start and end" = "首尾";
"Even taps, like detents." = "间隔均匀的轻触，如同档位。";
"Tiny taps that come faster and faster." = "细小的轻触，越来越密。";
"Even taps that grow stronger." = "间隔均匀的轻触，逐渐增强。";
"One tap as the effect starts, a firm one at full effect." = "效果开始时轻触一次，完全生效时重触一次。";
"Strength" = "力度";
"Taps" = "次数";
"Over the whole closing travel." = "整个合上过程中的轻触次数。";
"While opening" = "打开时也轻触";
"Show icon in menu bar" = "在菜单栏显示图标";
"When off, open Mac Duo again to show these settings." = "关闭后，再次打开 Mac Duo 即可显示这些设置。";
"Show angle in menu bar" = "在菜单栏显示角度";
"Launch at login" = "登录时启动";
"Reset" = "重置";
"Quit" = "退出";
"Made by " = "作者：";
"Screen Recording permission is required to show the depth effect." = "需要屏幕录制权限才能显示景深效果。";
"Open System Settings" = "打开系统设置";
"Could not open System Settings. Open it manually and enable screen recording for Mac Duo under Privacy & Security." = "无法打开系统设置。请手动打开，在“隐私与安全性”中为 Mac Duo 开启屏幕录制权限。";
"Language" = "语言";
"System" = "跟随系统";
"Chinese (Simplified)" = "简体中文";
